.DS_Store
*.log
node_modules/
docs/brainstorm/
docs/plan/
docs/reviews/
docs/hotfix-review/
docs/code-review/
docs/debriefs/
evals/results/

# Session transcripts a multi-turn eval run writes back into the case directory.
# The input is history.jsonl; everything else there is a run artifact.
evals/*/*/*.jsonl
!evals/*/*/history.jsonl
# Name the artifact, not every directory at this depth: `evals/*/*/*/` also swallowed the
# graders/ of every case not yet tracked, and four cases were committed without them.
evals/*/*/subagents/
